    <h1 class="section-title">Typing is the bottleneck.<br>Speaking is the fix.</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="prose" style="margin-top:34px">
    <p data-reveal>Super Flow exists because typing slows down thinking. The fastest writers we know dictate first and edit second — but every existing tool either ships transcripts full of <em>um</em>, <em>like</em>, and run-on sentences, or leaves you copy-pasting between a recorder and your editor.</p>
    <p data-reveal>Super Flow puts polished prose directly into whatever app you are focused on. Press <kbd>F9</kbd>, speak, release. The text that appears reads like you wrote it carefully — because behind the scenes we remove fillers, fix grammar, match your tone, and respect the context (code editor vs Slack vs documents).</p>
    <p data-reveal>We are small, built in the open, and care more about getting out of your way than about adding features. If you have a feature request or a bug, write to us — we read everything.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="contact-block" data-reveal>
